  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "Fierce exile-dwarves who prize vengeance, daring craft, and the right of each clan to rule itself.",
    "one_paragraph": "The Varkrul-Zhad were broken from older holds by feud and doom, and they wear that rupture as a badge of fierce pride. Their fortress-settlements are loud with oath songs, blood claims, and contests of forge skill. They admire boldness, remember slights for generations, and treat strangers as future enemies until proven otherwise through deeds of strength."
